Z||000000||turbo86se||04-28-2001||07:23 PM||||<BR>Holy Cow I am so happy!!!<P>Today my mechanic and I installed the starter and the battery, and it fired!<BR>If the computer and V6 fuel pump were hooked up, it would have held an idle!!<P>It's got good engine pressure, and the tranmission spit out all fluid, so that's working!! YEAH!!!<P>To those of you that are new, the yellow Fiero below is my 88 coupe with T-Tops, and it's getting a mint 55K mile 88 V6 installed. It's been a slow conversion, but it will be worth it!!  <P>I'll be in Carlisle with this Fiero, and I'll have a huge smile on my face!!  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||10
