Z||000002||Sanfran||04-28-2001||11:41 PM||||Do you have a turbo on your '86 V6; if so what kind is it and what's it like.  What kind of power increase do you get.  I want to do mine eventually.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1626330&a=12427866&p=45623747"> <BR>'86 2m4 <BR>Modified w/V6||||reg||1
Z||000003||turbo86se||04-29-2001||12:41 AM||||FieroJoe, it's been over a year. Uhh, since I drove my '88 Fiero last. LOL<BR>My mechanic has really put this off, which I wasn't too happy about, but now he knows he's got to finish it.<P>Sanfran, yes I do have a MillerWoods turbo system on my '86SE. Lately I've been driving it a lot. The weather has been excellent. Sometimes the Fiero scares me, it's really quick. I love it when you let off the gas at 100 and see the front end "drop." Then you notice your heart is pounding, and you're looking in the rearviewmirrow for blue lights.  The turbo makes a huge difference. Some of the North Florida club members will tell you first hand, they made me do a "drive-by."<BR>If you're in Wiliamsburg this summer you'll see it first hand. ||||reg||1
