Z||000007||2xsess||04-29-2001||01:12 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by turbo86se:<BR><B>Sanfran, yes I do have a MillerWoods turbo system on my '86SE. Lately I've been driving it a lot. The weather has been excellent. Sometimes the Fiero scares me, it's really quick. I love it when you let off the gas at 100 and see the front end "drop." Then you notice your heart is pounding, and you're looking in the rearviewmirrow for blue lights.  The turbo makes a huge difference. Some of the North Florida club members will tell you first hand, they made me do a "drive-by."</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I convoyed with Joel from here to Jacksonville and I was there for the "drive-by" all I could say was WOW!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>WOW, finally huh Joel...Glad to hear there's more progress being made.<BR>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>  <B>*For Sale*<BR>        $2000obo</B>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">         <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 04-29-2001).]||||reg||1
